1.Common Jenkins build failures and Conditions:

  1. Git checkout failed -  invalid credentials - verify github credential

  2. Maven build failed  -  Dependeancy issue   - run mvn clean install

  3. permission denied   -  Linux permission    - check chomd ownership

  4. Docker build faild  -  Dockerfile issue    - Check dockerfile and build context

  5. Docker push faild.  -  Authentictons issue - Verify registery login

  6. SonarQube faild.    -  Quality gate failed - check SonarQube report

  7. Kubernates deployment failed - Cluster/config issue  - check kubctl describe pod

  8. outoff memory - insufficient resources - check memory and jvm setting


2.Important troubleshooting commands

  1. Linux server check 
      common log directory is /var/log 

      df -h   - Check disk space 
      free -m - memory usage
      top.    - Displays real-time CPU and memory utilization.
      uptime. -  Shows system uptime and load average.
      du -sh  - identify large directory and files
      ps aux	- Running processes
      tail -n 50 app.log - Displays the last 50 lines
      tail -f app.log. 	- Continuously monitors new log entries

